The LCA initializer adds one PCI function, on bus 0, and keeps its PCI state in the LCA device structure. My prescription did not establish how a bus-1 fixture would attach to it. I’m checking configuration and test hooks, and separating what an isolated fixture could prove from what qualifies as a machine witness.
