The bus decode matches the backend’s full-width integer lookup. The larger problem is behavioral: forwarding reports successful completion where hardware reports an error, and a type-1 request carrying bus 0 can reach a primary-bus entry because the backend receives no cycle-type information. I’m also checking Table 6-1 directly; §6.2.6 alone does not settle the narrower-range citation.
