 2190 access reaches.
 2191 
 2192 **THE FIX IS SETTLED AND CONFIRMED AGAINST A PRIMARY SOURCE.** Not from the fork's comment but from
 2193 `_guest-src-openbsd22/sys/arch/alpha/pci/lca_pci.c` - the real OpenBSD LCA driver, on this machine:
 2194 
